ERROR:  cannot insert into the pg_repack_safe record table
DETAIL:  Only REPACK (CONCURRENTLY) writes records. A record names a table by OID and a transaction by ID, which mean something only in the database cluster that wrote it.
HINT:  If logical replication delivered this row: on the publisher, exclude the record table from the publication (ALTER PUBLICATION ... SET ALL TABLES EXCEPT (TABLE repack_safe.rewrites)); then, on the subscriber, run ALTER SUBSCRIPTION ... REFRESH PUBLICATION. See "Logical Replication" in doc/installation.md.
COPY repack_safe.rewrites FROM STDIN;
